<title>USA: Gold Banc sets initial quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Gold Banc sets initial quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LEAWOOD, Kan. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold Banc Corp said Monday it set its initial quarterly dividend at $0.03 a share.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable May 30 to shareholders of record on May 15, Gold Banc said.</p>
<p>((-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
